{"unit_id":"yupaoa__dsh-citation#card-zh","repo":"yupaoa/dsh-citation","commit":"54539595d86c4e5a57e65ab32a74c48fb5472f9c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-citation 是面向 DSH 网页端的回复引用插件。它为已完成的 assistant 回复提供右键菜单，可把选中的原文作为不可编辑的引用胶囊插入输入框；发送时编码为带轮次和字符区间出处的引用块，并在消息气泡中折叠显示。还支持悬停查看原文、重复引用拦截和回退草稿重建，适合需要准确指回先前回答片段的对话。需要 DSH >= 0.2.1-rc.3；不配置额外密钥或服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:350-365","client.js:483-507","client.js:1074-1092","client.js:1402-1417","package.json:34-45"]}
{"unit_id":"yupaoa__dsh-citation#card-en","repo":"yupaoa/dsh-citation","commit":"54539595d86c4e5a57e65ab32a74c48fb5472f9c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-citation lets DSH web users quote selected passages from assistant replies. Right-click adds an uneditable chip to the composer; sending includes the turn and character range, and the message folds the citation back into a chip. Requires DSH >= 0.2.1-rc.3; no extra keys or services.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:350-365","client.js:483-507","client.js:1074-1092","client.js:1402-1417","package.json:34-45"]}
