{"unit_id":"yupaoa__dsh-citation#feature-1","repo":"yupaoa/dsh-citation","commit":"54539595d86c4e5a57e65ab32a74c48fb5472f9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-citation 的功能「右键添加引用」：在已完成的 assistant 回复中选中同一正文的一段文字并右键，选择“添加到对话”；有效选区才会出现自定义菜单，引用被插入输入框。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:350-365","client.js:1074-1092"]}
