{"unit_id":"yupaoa__dsh-citation#feature-4","repo":"yupaoa/dsh-citation","commit":"54539595d86c4e5a57e65ab32a74c48fb5472f9c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-citation 的功能「回退草稿恢复」：宿主回退时重新写入包含引用块的草稿，插件的草稿守卫会尝试还原为引用胶囊和正文。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:625-673","client.js:1410-1414"]}
